			"name": "Lightslinger",
			"tooltip": "After using an Ability, Lucian's next Attack within @PassiveDuration@ seconds will fire two shots. The second shot deals <physicalDamage>@TotalDamage@ physical damage</physicalDamage> to the target, increased to <physicalDamage>@MinionDamage@</physicalDamage> against minions.<br><br><attention>Vigilance: </attention>When Lucian is directly healed or shielded by an ally, or when a nearby enemy Champion is <status>Immobilized</status>, his pistols become <keywordMajor>Overcharged</keywordMajor> with energy, causing his next @NumAuto@ basic attacks to deal an additional <magicDamage>@PassiveTotalDamage@ magic damage</magicDamage>.",
